  <Thumbnail>e4472906-4bc4-43e7-b7d6-d7e3ecf6d1e8</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="23-06-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="08-10-15" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Added virtual dimmer cell mode and new extended mode." />
  <History Date="08-10-15" Author="Peter Budd" Comment="Added max pan tilt degrees." />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="13-07-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID to ExtendedCellVDim mode" />
  <History Date="08-09-16" Author="Gregory Haynes" Comment="Added ESTA manufacturer ID." />
  <History Date="02-10-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added RDM Model ID" />
  <History Date="23-03-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed move in dark range.  Standardised across product range." />
  <History Date="23-03-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed Standard and Basic channel mapping (swapped col preset dim and control)." />
  <History Date="31-03-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised Col Preset function names across product range.  Added vdim to Extended mode cells and removed 'ExtendedCellVDim' mode." />
  <History Date="18-06-18" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added compatibility in response to customer bug report.  Added channel counts to mode names.  Added product thumbnail." />
